# Deliberately empty.
#
# This plugin needs adl-ftp-plugin -- it decodes with that plugin's decoder
# registry and its shared pipeline seams -- but that is an *installation*
# dependency, not a pip one. ADL builds INSTALLED_APPS by scanning the folders
# under ADL_PLUGIN_DIRS, so pip-installing the package would put the module on
# the path without ever registering the app, its models or its migrations.
#
# Declare it in the instance's plugins.toml instead, ahead of this plugin, at
# 0.12.0 or later (the release carrying the file-matching and decoder-config
# seams). Without it this plugin fails loudly at Django import, which is the
# right way for a missing hard dependency to behave.
